# Design source assets: ~31 MB of logo/palette exploration PNGs. Kept on disk
# for reference, deliberately out of git — permanent history weight for files
# that aren't source. The shipped mark is exported into the app, not read
# from here. Moved from docs/branding + docs/marketing into gtm/brand/assets.
gtm/brand/assets/

# Local agent caches and generated packages are not project state. The shared
# TSP Push source is the exception: Codex loads it in place and the Claude
# package is generated from these tracked files.
.agents/*
!.agents/skills/
.agents/skills/*
!.agents/skills/tsp-push/
!.agents/skills/tsp-push/**

# Marketing site (website/). The HubSpot CLI credential belongs in
# ~/.hscli/config.yml, outside this repo entirely — see website/docs/security.md.
# These entries are a backstop for older CLI versions that wrote credentials into
# the working directory, not the primary control.
website/node_modules/
website/**/hubspot.config.yml
hubspot.config.yml
.hscli/
